\newlabel{app:discovery_results}{{B}{125}{Conformance of All Discovered Nets}{appendix.B}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {B.1}{\ignorespaces Conformance of all discovered nets on the training log (2 March to 11 April 2026) and the test log (13 to 30 April 2026). Fitting visits: share of visits whose complete sequence the net accepts. Precision: escaping-edges precision on alignments with exact silent closure. Seq.\ accepted: training sequences accepted, of 82. Unseen test seq.: test sequences that do not occur in training and are accepted, of 16. Gen.: token-based generalisation on the training log; it is reported for completeness but not used for the selection, because it rewards nets that use few transitions often and barely separates the nets. Values of unsound nets are diagnostic only. The prefix tree is a reference that accepts exactly the training sequences.}}{126}{table.caption.79}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:app_e1_conformance}{{B.1}{126}{Conformance of all discovered nets on the training log (2 March to 11 April 2026) and the test log (13 to 30 April 2026). Fitting visits: share of visits whose complete sequence the net accepts. Precision: escaping-edges precision on alignments with exact silent closure. Seq.\ accepted: training sequences accepted, of 82. Unseen test seq.: test sequences that do not occur in training and are accepted, of 16. Gen.: token-based generalisation on the training log; it is reported for completeness but not used for the selection, because it rewards nets that use few transitions often and barely separates the nets. Values of unsound nets are diagnostic only. The prefix tree is a reference that accepts exactly the training sequences}{table.caption.79}{}}
